on\"><img alt=\"OnACanonArticle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-image-key=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/47/OnACanonArticle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250314035517\" /></a></span></span>\n</p><div class=\"disambig noprint darkbackground1\" style=\"border-radius: 10px; padding: 5px 0\">For other uses, see <b><a href=\"/wiki/Rey_(disambiguation)\" class=\"mw-disambig\" title=\"Rey (disambiguation)\">Rey</a></b>.</div>\n<div id=\"Update\" class=\"mobile-hide headertemplate messagebox noprint iumb hidable\" style=\"background: #EEE8AA; color: #000; border-radius:10px\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0px\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-table-container\">\n<table cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"hidable-content\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td class=\"iumb-icon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20080821014929\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Z-95 Headhunter\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"71\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Z-95 Headhunter.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Z-95_Headhunter.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/4c/Z-95_Headhunter.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20080821014929\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-main\">\n<p><span class=\"iumb-caption\">Content approaching.</span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"iumb-message\">Parts of this article are no longer up to date. This article needs updating from multiple sources. Click the dropdow