kywalker: The Visual Dictionary\">Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: The Visual Dictionary</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Rise_of_Skywalker:_Expanded_Edition\" title=\"Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: Expanded Edition\">Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: Expanded Edition</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Rise_of_Skywalker:_A_Junior_Novel\" title=\"Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: A Junior Novel\">Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: A Junior Novel</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Build_Your_Own_R2-D2_6\" title=\"Star Wars: Build Your Own R2-D2 6\">Star Wars: Build Your Own R2-D2 6</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Saga_of_Rey\" title=\"The Saga of Rey\">The Saga of Rey</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/The_Star_Wars_Book\" title=\"The Star Wars Book\">The Star Wars Book</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Rise_and_Fall_of_the_Galactic_Empire\" title=\"Star Wars: The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire\">Star Wars: The Rise and Fall of the Galactic Empire</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Galaxy%27s_Edge_%E2%80%93_Echoes_of_the_Empire_1\" title=\"Galaxy&#39;s Edge – Echoes of the Empire 1\">Galaxy's Edge – Echoes of the Empire 1</a></i>\n</p>\n</div></div></span>\n<p><span class=\"iumb-comment\">Please update the article to include missing information, and remove this template when finished.</span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td>\n<td class=\"iumb-hidable-button\"><span class=\"hidable-button\"></span>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-character pi-theme-Jedi pi-layout-default\">\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"imagefallback\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/2b/Rey_TROS_Fathead.png/revision/latest?cb=20231113074423\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Rey TROS Fathead\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/2b/Rey_TROS_Fathead.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/500?cb=202311130