he_Rise_of_Skywalker:_A_Junior_Novel\" title=\"Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: A Junior Novel\">Star Wars: The Rise of Skywalker: A Junior Novel</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-The&#95;Star&#95;Wars&#95;Book-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-The_Star_Wars_Book_10-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Star_Wars_Book\" title=\"The Star Wars Book\">The Star Wars Book</a></i></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Episode&#95;VIII-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Episode_VIII_11-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Episode_VIII_The_Last_Jedi\" title=\"Star Wars: Episode VIII The Last Jedi\"><i>Star Wars</i>: Episode VIII <i>The Last Jedi</i></a></span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-Star&#95;Wars:&#95;The&#95;Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Jedi:&#95;The&#95;Chronicles&#95;of&#95;Luke&#95;Skywalker-12\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-Star_Wars:_The_Secrets_of_the_Jedi:_The_Chronicles_of_Luke_Skywalker_12-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Secrets_of_the_Jedi:_The_Chronicles_of_Luke_Skywalker\" title=\"Star Wars: The Secrets of the Jedi: The Chronicles of Luke Skywalker\">Star Wars: The Secrets of the Jedi: The Chronicles of Luke Skywalker</a></i></span>\n</li>\n</ol></div></div>","properties":{"displaytitle":"Rey Skywalker","infoboxes":"[{\"parser_tag_version\":5,\"data\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":[{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/static.wikia.nocookie.net\\/starwars\\/images\\/2\\/2b\\/Rey_TROS_Fathead.png\\/revision\\/latest?cb=20231113074423\",\"name\":\"Rey TROS Fathead.png\",\"key\":\"Rey_TROS_Fathead.png\",\"alt\":\"\",\"caption\":\"\",\"isVideo\":false,\"item-name\":null,\"source\":\"imagefallback\"}]},{\"type\":\"title\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"Rey Skywalker\",\"item-name\":null,\"source\":\"name\"}},{\"type\":\"navigation\",\"data\":{\"value\":\"<center><\\/center>\",\"item